{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1038222-real-people","id":1038222,"title":"Real People","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-25T20:06:28-08:00","id":1038222,"title":"Real People","content":"As I work through the oWoD database, I make special note of anyone I recognize or suspect to be a real (or mythically 'real' e.g. Merlin/Faustus, or an extremely thin 'expy' of one like the David Copperfield reference) person. I've recently finally gotten to an end-state with the Mage dataset (though there's always more to add - a few novels, M20, etc - that may lead to slight changes in the long term, 99% of extant oWoD material is in there with over 7000 unique entries) and I thought I'd share, while I get the demographics info prepped, the list of people flagged as being real, along with their relevant trad/craft/convention, essence, etc where known.<br /> <br /> I may have missed a few on the tags, so if you know of one I don't have listed, do let me know. Chances are they're in the database but I managed to miss hitting yes on historical figure.<br /> <br /> James Stirling (Order of Hermes)<br /> Adolf Hitler (Unknown)<br /> Aleister Crowley (Barabbi Hermetic/Ecstatic. Incidentally, if the source that has Hitler himself as a mage, Dark Destinies 2, is canonical (and it\u2019s likely to get a reissue soon by nWhiteWolf with proper WoD branding if DD1 is any indicator), then Crowley may not have been a full Barabbi as he went to fight Hitler's cabal of nazi nephandi in 1945 and again in 1947. Certainly, it\u2019d be an interesting take on the man to have him \u2018fall\u2019 but remain the profoundly independent, disagreeable, downright cuntish but strangely moral (by his own standard, at least) chap that he was.)<br /> Alan Turing (Virtual Adept)<br /> Alessandro Cagliostro/'Giuseppe Balsamo' (Hermetic or Hedge)<br /> Apollonius of Tyana (Hermetic)<br /> Captain Henry Wagner Halleck (Hermetic)<br /> Captain James Cook (Void Seekers)<br /> Charles Babbage (Electrodyne Engineers)<br /> Copernicus (Artificers)<br /> David Copperfield/\u2019Copperfelt\u2019 (Syndicate)<br /> David Livingstone (Void Engineers)<br /> Dr. Albert Hoffman (Children of Knowledge)<br /> Dr. George Faustus (Unknown)<br /> Dr. Johannes Faust (Hermetic, House Tytalus)<br /> Dr. John (Bata\u2019a)<br /> Edward Kelly (Dreamspeaker)<br /> Frater Recnartus (Unknown)<br /> Giambatista Piranesi (Hermetic)<br /> Gilles de Rais (Barabbi \u2013 either Hermetic or Gabrielite. Ex Miscellanea if Hermetic, or perhaps one, then the other, then Nephandi)<br /> Giorgio Vasari (potentially Awakened but not certain)<br /> Grigory Novykh/'Rasputin' (Ecstatic)<br /> Hippocrates (Aeduna/Cosian)<br /> Howard Hughes (Unknown)<br /> Hypatia (Hermetic)<br /> Hypatia of Alexandria (Hermetic<br /> Isaac Newtown (Void Engineers)<br /> Jack Parsons (Sons of Ether \u2013 a rather odd pick as he was more a Hermeticist in life)<br /> Jesus (Sorceror. Yes, <i>Jesus</i>.)<br /> Jim Morrison (Ecstatic.)<br /> Jimi Hendrix (Died becoming a shaman)<br /> Joan de Arc (Orphan)<br /> Johann Kepler (Void Engineer)<br /> John Dee (Hermeticist of House Bonisagus<br /> Joseph Gallagher (Nephandi, the Zodiac Killer)<br /> Jules Verne (Sons of Ether)<br /> King George the Third (Harbinger of Avalon)<br /> King Sejong of Korea (High Artisans)<br /> King Solomon (Pre-Hermetic)<br /> Leonardo di Vinci (Sons of Ether)<br /> Lorenza Feliciani (Hedge mage)<br /> Lucius Apuleius (Unknown)<br /> Marie Laveau (Bata\u2019a)<br /> Michael Faraday (Electrodyne Engineer)<br /> Morgan le Fay (Old Faither, fae descent)<br /> Myrddin/Merlin (Verbena/Aeduna/Old Faither/Hermetic)<br /> Nathaniel Jones (Technocrat)<br /> Norman Borlaug (Progenitor)<br /> Pedro de Ursua (Technocrat)<br /> Phillipus Aureolus Paracelsus (Hermeticist of House Bonisagus)<br /> Plotinus (Pre-Hermetic)<br /> Pope Sylvester (Unknown)<br /> Prince Edward, Duke of Kent and Strathearn (Harbinger of Avalon)<br /> Prince Yusupov (Nephandi)<br /> Proclus (Hermeticist)<br /> Pythagoras of Samos ('Hermeticist')<br /> Queen Victoria (Harbinger of Avalon, but this is debated even within the sources)<br /> Rabbi Moses bin Maimonides<br /> Rafael Rivera (sorcerer or mage)<br /> Roger Bacon (Artificer or Hermetic)<br /> Simon Magus (Pre-Hermetic)<br /> Sir Thomas Scotte (Hermetic)<br /> Tesla (Sons of Ether)<br /> The Oracle of Greece<br /> Tychoides (Void Engineers)<br /> William Bringhust (Chorister)<br /> Zarathustra","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5307,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","user":"loomer","date":". 01-28-2017, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T20:07:35-08:00","id":1038223,"title":"","content":"For bonus points, more than a few of these names are also changelings, werewolves, kinfolk, or vampires, since every line likes to claim every famous person as one of their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T06:49:55-08:00","id":1038392,"title":"","content":"Forgive me but what is Dark Destinies 1 and 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T07:13:09-08:00","id":1038404,"title":"","content":"They were short story anthologies oWhiteWolf put out back in the mid-90s, containing stories both custom written for the oWoD and that the editors generally liked. Their canonicity was ambiguous as they had a 'world of darkness' logo slapped on but it was the early WoD weirdness stage. However, nWhiteWolf recently reissued a new digital edition of Dark Destinies 1 with a new story, explicitly giving their full stamp of approval to the work, which to me indicates it should be considered mostly canonical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T08:25:23-08:00","id":1038430,"title":"","content":"Wait, Albert Einstein wasn't snagged as a Void Engineer, but Issac Newton was? What are you doing White Wolf?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T10:23:33-08:00","id":1038470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1038222-real-people?p=1038430#post1038430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, Albert Einstein wasn't snagged as a Void Engineer, but Issac Newton was? What are you doing White Wolf?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was acceptable in the 90s. It was acceptable at the time...<br /> <br /> Incidentally, this forms another major break with Mage from the rest of the WoD, since in some of those cases, the claim was that the individual in question was entirely human. Only the slip-ups in KotE where Tou Mu was copied entirely off of her D&amp;D presentation and they threw in that devil archer from Deities and Demigods as well really match it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-27T19:07:47-08:00","id":1039210,"title":"","content":"No Alan Turing? The first M\u00e1ster of the VA?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T07:09:11-08:00","id":1039408,"title":"","content":"Don't be silly, everyone knows Alan Turing is a myth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T07:19:30-08:00","id":1039410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1038222-real-people?p=1039408#post1039408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't be silly, everyone knows Alan Turing is a myth.</div> </div> </div> </div>And yet, merlin's on the list...<br /> <br /> Loving these priorities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T08:09:25-08:00","id":1039418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1038222-real-people?p=1039410#post1039410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And yet, merlin's on the list...<br /> <br /> Loving these priorities.</div> </div> </div> </div>As we all know, Merlin is as real as Red Mercury, but Turing is a myth, like global warming or leprechauns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T08:40:36-08:00","id":1039430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> O